* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch/cmd scripts MUST be CRLF or they silently fail on Windows.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# The vendored loader is a redistributed binary. `* text=auto` above leaves it
# to git's content heuristic, which happens to get it right today because
# dinput8.dll has a NUL at byte 3. Stated outright instead: a normalised DLL is
# one whose 0x0a bytes were rewritten, and the arch and payload checks that
# would notice only run after it is already committed.
*.dll binary
